  "label": "American Flag Symbolism",
  "description": "The American flag in the image is used as a symbol of national identity and patriotism. In this context, it is juxtaposed with the anti-immigrant message to imply that the speaker is defending the nation or its values. The flag is often used in political and social discourse to evoke feelings of loyalty, belonging, and moral authority, even when used to justify exclusionary or hateful ideologies.",
